(5678274, 825809, 68947, '<td valign="top">This one made me really stop, look and think. It''s quite unusual and strangely intriguing. It''s out of focus, quite artsy and grabs attention fully.  I''m sure that many voters are going to stop and take a really good look at this one....either that, or click on past it :)  One way or the other, this one has a lot of interest.  Not sure how to categorize this one but, from me....just on the pure esthetics, deep meaning and artsy feel to it...it''s getting a 9 from me!  (I''m not giving many of those out in this challenge! :))  By the way, I''m sensing another type of award coming up for this one!  Good going!</td>', 'This one made me really stop, look and think. It''s quite unusual and strangely intriguing. It''s out of focus, quite artsy and grabs attention fully.  I''m sure that many voters are going to stop and take a really good look at this one....either that, or click on past it :)  One way or the other, this one has a lot of interest.  Not sure how to categorize this one but, from me....just on the pure esthetics, deep meaning and artsy feel to it...it''s getting a 9 from me!  (I''m not giving many of those out in this challenge! :))  By the way, I''m sensing another type of award coming up for this one!  Good going!', '2009-10-07 11:49:40.000000', NULL, 1),
