(5679670, 825956, 110292, '<td valign="top">Meets Challenge: 2 of 3.  It''s low key, but just barely imho.<br/>Technical: 1 of 3.  The moire within the feather and the overblown whites and odd brownish area on the bottom right of the feather are distracting.<br/>Emotion: 1 of 3.  It''s a neat picture, but it doesn''t say anything to me.<br/>Awe: 0 of 1.</td>', 'Meets Challenge: 2 of 3.  It''s low key, but just barely imho.Technical: 1 of 3.  The moire within the feather and the overblown whites and odd brownish area on the bottom right of the feather are distracting.Emotion: 1 of 3.  It''s a neat picture, but it doesn''t say anything to me.Awe: 0 of 1.', '2009-10-08 01:08:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(5679684, 826161, 110292, '<td valign="top">Meets Challenge: 2 of 3.  I''d like to see less fur, more highlighted edges. To me, part of low key is what''s not there.<br/>Technical: 2 of 3.  Good composition, but the grey background/rock-things (especially the lower one) are distracting from the subject.<br/>Emotion: 1 of 3.  Just missing something. Kinda boring?<br/>Awe: 0 of 1.</td>', 'Meets Challenge: 2 of 3.  I''d like to see less fur, more highlighted edges. To me, part of low key is what''s not there.Technical: 2 of 3.  Good composition, but the grey background/rock-things (especially the lower one) are distracting from the subject.Emotion: 1 of 3.  Just missing something. Kinda boring?Awe: 0 of 1.', '2009-10-08 01:12:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(5679688, 825740, 110292, '<td valign="top">Meets Challenge: 0 of 3. Not low key. Way too much sky.<br/>Technical: 1 of 3.  Decent composition, but the sky way overpowers the shadows and details under the construction area. Especially being a low key challenge, I''d like to see some of those details.<br/>Emotion: 1 of 3.  What are you telling me in this photo?  The angle intrigues me, but that''s it.<br/>Awe: 0 of 1.</td>', 'Meets Challenge: 0 of 3. Not low key. Way too much sky.Technical: 1 of 3.  Decent composition, but the sky way overpowers the shadows and details under the construction area. Especially being a low key challenge, I''d like to see some of those details.Emotion: 1 of 3.  What are you telling me in this photo?  The angle intrigues me, but that''s it.Awe: 0 of 1.', '2009-10-08 01:16:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(5679695, 825913, 110292, '<td valign="top">Meets Challenge: 2 of 3. Just barely low key, for me.  There''s a lot of bright outdoors that take most of the focus.<br/>Technical: 2 of 3.  Composition is good, plenty of interesting things to keep the eyes busy, but I''m drawn to the tree in the upper window which is definitely not low key.  And the parts that are low key, they have pretty obvious pixelation.<br/>Emotion: 2 of 3.  I want to go there.  I want to see what else is in that room.  I want to know who lived there.  Good.<br/>Awe: 0 of 1.</td>', 'Meets Challenge: 2 of 3. Just barely low key, for me.  There''s a lot of bright outdoors that take most of the focus.Technical: 2 of 3.  Composition is good, plenty of interesting things to keep the eyes busy, but I''m drawn to the tree in the upper window which is definitely not low key.  And the parts that are low key, they have pretty obvious pixelation.Emotion: 2 of 3.  I want to go there.  I want to see what else is in that room.  I want to know who lived there.  Good.Awe: 0 of 1.', '2009-10-08 01:19:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(5679699, 825855, 110292, '<td valign="top">Meets Challenge: 3 of 3.<br/>Technical: 2 of 3.  Good subject, but the dark parts have very obvious pixel noise.<br/>Emotion: 3 of 3. Very good.<br/>Awe: 0 of 1.</td>', 'Meets Challenge: 3 of 3.Technical: 2 of 3.  Good subject, but the dark parts have very obvious pixel noise.Emotion: 3 of 3. Very good.Awe: 0 of 1.', '2009-10-08 01:21:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(5679707, 826114, 110292, '<td valign="top">Meets Challenge: 2 of 3.  A *liiiitle* too much skin showing.  I''d have liked it to be a little darker.<br/>Technical: 3 of 3.  Especially like that you *didn''t* make this black and white (like everyone else seems to be doing).  Candle implies warm, warm implies red, not white. There are a few stray blue pixels that probably should have been edited out, but that''s fine.<br/>Emotion: 2 of 3.  <br/>Awe: 0 of 1.</td>', 'Meets Challenge: 2 of 3.  A *liiiitle* too much skin showing.  I''d have liked it to be a little darker.Technical: 3 of 3.  Especially like that you *didn''t* make this black and white (like everyone else seems to be doing).  Candle implies warm, warm implies red, not white. There are a few stray blue pixels that probably should have been edited out, but that''s fine.Emotion: 2 of 3.  Awe: 0 of 1.', '2009-10-08 01:25:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(5679716, 826101, 110292, '<td valign="top">Meets Challenge: 3 of 3.<br/>Technical: 2 of 3. I like the colors in the lens, but don''t like that I can so easily see your umbrella. <br/>Emotion: 2 of 3.  Looks like a good friend.  I wonder what kind of trouble you two used to get into.<br/>Awe: 0 of 1.</td>', 'Meets Challenge: 3 of 3.Technical: 2 of 3. I like the colors in the lens, but don''t like that I can so easily see your umbrella. Emotion: 2 of 3.  Looks like a good friend.  I wonder what kind of trouble you two used to get into.Awe: 0 of 1.', '2009-10-08 01:28:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(5679726, 825926, 110292, '<td valign="top">Meets Challenge: 1 of 3.  This is just barely low key, for me.<br/>Technical: 3 of 3. Very good shot.<br/>Emotion: 2 of 3.  Action, suspense (literally, and in wondering what happens next), color.  Good.<br/>Awe: 0 of 1.</td>', 'Meets Challenge: 1 of 3.  This is just barely low key, for me.Technical: 3 of 3. Very good shot.Emotion: 2 of 3.  Action, suspense (literally, and in wondering what happens next), color.  Good.Awe: 0 of 1.', '2009-10-08 01:30:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(5679728, 826121, 110292, '<td valign="top">Meets Challenge: 2 of 3.  A little too much light for me, but good.<br/>Technical: 2 of 3.  The black areas on the left corners distract, otherwise good.<br/>Emotion: 3 of 3.  What''s on the other side?  Adventure?  Heartache?  I guess I''ll never know.<br/>Awe: 0 of 1.</td>', 'Meets Challenge: 2 of 3.  A little too much light for me, but good.Technical: 2 of 3.  The black areas on the left corners distract, otherwise good.Emotion: 3 of 3.  What''s on the other side?  Adventure?  Heartache?  I guess I''ll never know.Awe: 0 of 1.', '2009-10-08 01:32:23.000000', NULL, 1),
