(5679745, 826048, 110292, '<td valign="top">Meets Challenge: 2 of 3.  Those white trucks are really bright. A little too bright for my taste.<br/>Technical: 2 of 3.  A really good shot, but that white thing on the left interrupts the flow of the truck cabs.  I''d have cropped it out. <br/>Emotion: 3 of 3.  I''ve been in their shoes, and seeing this brings back memories of long road trips at night. And the red lights dragging through reminds me that there''s some lonely trucker out there that isn''t getting the rest he needs.<br/>Awe: 0 of 1.</td>', 'Meets Challenge: 2 of 3.  Those white trucks are really bright. A little too bright for my taste.Technical: 2 of 3.  A really good shot, but that white thing on the left interrupts the flow of the truck cabs.  I''d have cropped it out. Emotion: 3 of 3.  I''ve been in their shoes, and seeing this brings back memories of long road trips at night. And the red lights dragging through reminds me that there''s some lonely trucker out there that isn''t getting the rest he needs.Awe: 0 of 1.', '2009-10-08 01:40:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(5679752, 825833, 110292, '<td valign="top">Meets Challenge: 2 of 3.  I could have used a little more lows.<br/>Technical: 3 of 3.<br/>Emotion: 3 of 3.  <br/>Awe: 1 of 1.<br/> <br/>A great shot!</td>', 'Meets Challenge: 2 of 3.  I could have used a little more lows.Technical: 3 of 3.Emotion: 3 of 3.  Awe: 1 of 1. A great shot!', '2009-10-08 01:42:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(5679770, 826212, 110292, '<td valign="top">Meets Challenge: 3 of 3.<br/>Technical: 2 of 3.  Wish those reflections were gone, they break up the cool curvy feel.<br/>Emotion: 2 of 3.  I dunno, something''s missing.  I need something more to draw me in and make we want to keep looking.<br/>Awe: 0 of 1.</td>', 'Meets Challenge: 3 of 3.Technical: 2 of 3.  Wish those reflections were gone, they break up the cool curvy feel.Emotion: 2 of 3.  I dunno, something''s missing.  I need something more to draw me in and make we want to keep looking.Awe: 0 of 1.', '2009-10-08 01:49:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(5679776, 826173, 108525, '<td valign="top">Just a little too dark.  You have to study it for a long time to even make out that something is in the glass.  Or maybe a slight uplight to iluminate only the wine in the glass?<br/>I only mention this because it seems that the wine is your intended subject.</td>', 'Just a little too dark.  You have to study it for a long time to even make out that something is in the glass.  Or maybe a slight uplight to iluminate only the wine in the glass?I only mention this because it seems that the wine is your intended subject.', '2009-10-08 01:52:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(5679779, 826105, 108525, '<td valign="top">It''s too underexposed.  You can''t make out your intended subject.</td>', 'It''s too underexposed.  You can''t make out your intended subject.', '2009-10-08 01:53:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(5679783, 825665, 108525, '<td valign="top">It seems to lack contrast.  There is too much focused light hitting her in the chest.  I think your main light source should come from just behind and above her right shoulder, with maybe a tiny smidge coming from her direct left.</td>', 'It seems to lack contrast.  There is too much focused light hitting her in the chest.  I think your main light source should come from just behind and above her right shoulder, with maybe a tiny smidge coming from her direct left.', '2009-10-08 01:55:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(5679785, 826138, 110292, '<td valign="top">Meets Challenge: 3 of 3.<br/>Technical: 2 of 3.  That little thing in the lower corner...<br/>Emotion: 2 of 3.  Obviously it''s a staged photo, so don''t take this the wrong way.  I just wish it felt a little less staged.  Like you got this shot while he was playing or reading, instead of "here, sit down and look at the camera".  And I probably wouldn''t say that about an adult subject...  but he''s a kid, he should be doing kid things.  Right?  Little thing, really.  Great expression.<br/>Awe: 0 of 1.</td>', 'Meets Challenge: 3 of 3.Technical: 2 of 3.  That little thing in the lower corner...Emotion: 2 of 3.  Obviously it''s a staged photo, so don''t take this the wrong way.  I just wish it felt a little less staged.  Like you got this shot while he was playing or reading, instead of "here, sit down and look at the camera".  And I probably wouldn''t say that about an adult subject...  but he''s a kid, he should be doing kid things.  Right?  Little thing, really.  Great expression.Awe: 0 of 1.', '2009-10-08 01:55:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(5679788, 825815, 108525, '<td valign="top">I think you need to warm your white balance a bit.  The subject matter is a beautiful baby, so the photo shouldnt feel cold.</td>', 'I think you need to warm your white balance a bit.  The subject matter is a beautiful baby, so the photo shouldnt feel cold.', '2009-10-08 01:56:49.000000', NULL, 1),
