(5679805, 825297, 110292, '<td valign="top">Meets Challenge: 3 of 3.<br/>Technical: 3 of 3.<br/>Emotion: 2 of 3.  Just me... but I wish his head was facing a little more down.  It would give a sense of weight to that cross he''s baring. As it is, he looks more bored, than baring.<br/>Awe: 1 of 1.<br/> <br/>Great photo!  Really good job.<br/> <br/>Also, funny side note.  For the longest time, I thought that in the Alanis Morissette song "You Oughta Know" she kept referring to "the cross-eyed bear that you gave to me".  I couldn''t for the life of me figure out how that went with the rest of the song.  ;)</td>', 'Meets Challenge: 3 of 3.Technical: 3 of 3.Emotion: 2 of 3.  Just me... but I wish his head was facing a little more down.  It would give a sense of weight to that cross he''s baring. As it is, he looks more bored, than baring.Awe: 1 of 1. Great photo!  Really good job. Also, funny side note.  For the longest time, I thought that in the Alanis Morissette song "You Oughta Know" she kept referring to "the cross-eyed bear that you gave to me".  I couldn''t for the life of me figure out how that went with the rest of the song.  ;)', '2009-10-08 02:03:36.000000', NULL, 1),
