(5679820, 826144, 110292, '<td valign="top">Meets Challenge: 2 of 3. A little too much illumination on the plant for me.<br/>Technical: 3 of 3.<br/>Emotion: 1 of 3. A neat subject, but it doesn''t really draw me in.<br/>Awe: 0 of 1.</td>', 'Meets Challenge: 2 of 3. A little too much illumination on the plant for me.Technical: 3 of 3.Emotion: 1 of 3. A neat subject, but it doesn''t really draw me in.Awe: 0 of 1.', '2009-10-08 02:09:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(5679823, 826102, 108525, '<td valign="top">I think I could understand the composition if the guy were wearing a pair of well worn Levis.  The choice to go naked with tools is just a bit weird.  The drame of white knuckling a set of tools is lost without pants.</td>', 'I think I could understand the composition if the guy were wearing a pair of well worn Levis.  The choice to go naked with tools is just a bit weird.  The drame of white knuckling a set of tools is lost without pants.', '2009-10-08 02:10:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(5679824, 826191, 108525, '<td valign="top">I think the green needs to be brought out just a little more, and it would contrast the rest of the photo nicely.</td>', 'I think the green needs to be brought out just a little more, and it would contrast the rest of the photo nicely.', '2009-10-08 02:11:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(5679826, 826075, 108525, '<td valign="top">a tighter crop would add more drama.  there just seems to be too much dead space.</td>', 'a tighter crop would add more drama.  there just seems to be too much dead space.', '2009-10-08 02:13:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(5679832, 826159, 110292, '<td valign="top">Meets Challenge: 2 of 3.  It''s low key, but it''s more like just an underexposed shot than a dark shot with highlights. You know?<br/>Technical: 2 of 3. Again, looks underexposed, but not in a good way.<br/>Emotion: 1 of 3. I dunno... Just not feelin'' it I guess. Nothing necessarily wrong with it...  just..  <br/>Awe: 0 of 1.</td>', 'Meets Challenge: 2 of 3.  It''s low key, but it''s more like just an underexposed shot than a dark shot with highlights. You know?Technical: 2 of 3. Again, looks underexposed, but not in a good way.Emotion: 1 of 3. I dunno... Just not feelin'' it I guess. Nothing necessarily wrong with it...  just..  Awe: 0 of 1.', '2009-10-08 02:19:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(5679837, 826110, 109372, '<td valign="top">i just love this picture - the eyes have just enough highlights to draw you in...</td>', 'i just love this picture - the eyes have just enough highlights to draw you in...', '2009-10-08 02:20:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(5679839, 825982, 109372, '<td valign="top">love the water droplets - just enough detail.</td>', 'love the water droplets - just enough detail.', '2009-10-08 02:22:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(5679841, 826109, 108525, '<td valign="top">I think what this photo lacks is contrast and a tight crop.  I think you need to exclude everything but the cracker.  That would turn it from just a cracker on the table to something like the surface of a distacnt planet.  It would totally change the mood, drama, and perception of the subject....even if it is "just a cracker"</td>', 'I think what this photo lacks is contrast and a tight crop.  I think you need to exclude everything but the cracker.  That would turn it from just a cracker on the table to something like the surface of a distacnt planet.  It would totally change the mood, drama, and perception of the subject....even if it is "just a cracker"', '2009-10-08 02:22:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(5679844, 826137, 108525, '<td valign="top">I think a black piece of paper or material placed in front of the vase would have been beneficial.  The blue is very distracting from the most excellently shot rose.</td>', 'I think a black piece of paper or material placed in front of the vase would have been beneficial.  The blue is very distracting from the most excellently shot rose.', '2009-10-08 02:24:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(5679845, 825926, 108525, '<td valign="top">The DoF is a bit too shallow.  I would like to see at least all the immediate ripples in crisp focus.  It''s a shot that has been seen many times before, so it has to be perfect to stand out.</td>', 'The DoF is a bit too shallow.  I would like to see at least all the immediate ripples in crisp focus.  It''s a shot that has been seen many times before, so it has to be perfect to stand out.', '2009-10-08 02:26:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(5679847, 825840, 69368, '<td valign="top">really nice pic. she''s looking great. but it''s not really "Low Key" in my eyes</td>', 'really nice pic. she''s looking great. but it''s not really "Low Key" in my eyes', '2009-10-08 02:27:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(5679848, 825903, 108525, '<td valign="top">This is a hard one to shoot.  All the chrome tends to pick up lots of light and cause a lot of distracting points.  This really needs a center point of focus.  I''m not sure where my eyes should be looking.</td>', 'This is a hard one to shoot.  All the chrome tends to pick up lots of light and cause a lot of distracting points.  This really needs a center point of focus.  I''m not sure where my eyes should be looking.', '2009-10-08 02:29:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(5679849, 825582, 108525, '<td valign="top">There is a very distracting light behind the lowest center tassel.</td>', 'There is a very distracting light behind the lowest center tassel.', '2009-10-08 02:30:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(5679862, 826142, 108525, '<td valign="top">The gold and green...just gorgeous!</td>', 'The gold and green...just gorgeous!', '2009-10-08 02:41:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(5679864, 825630, 108525, '<td valign="top">I''m not sure what I''m looking at here.  There doesn''t seem to be a clear subject.</td>', 'I''m not sure what I''m looking at here.  There doesn''t seem to be a clear subject.', '2009-10-08 02:42:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(5679868, 826004, 108525, '<td valign="top">The white light coming from the bear''s left is very harsh.  You might try diffusing it with a piece of paper.  <br/>I think if you were just to eliminate the white light and try a super long exposure with just the red light from the bear''s right it would turn out cool.  It would give it the "evil toy" look.<br/>if you were to stick with the white light, I would move the bear to the right of the frame and center the nose on the right "thirds" imaginary line.<br/>If you were to use just the red, do the oppisite.</td>', 'The white light coming from the bear''s left is very harsh.  You might try diffusing it with a piece of paper.  I think if you were just to eliminate the white light and try a super long exposure with just the red light from the bear''s right it would turn out cool.  It would give it the "evil toy" look.if you were to stick with the white light, I would move the bear to the right of the frame and center the nose on the right "thirds" imaginary line.If you were to use just the red, do the oppisite.', '2009-10-08 02:47:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(5679869, 825790, 108525, '<td valign="top">The subject (the heart) needs to be in clear focus.</td>', 'The subject (the heart) needs to be in clear focus.', '2009-10-08 02:47:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(5679872, 825883, 108525, '<td valign="top">the white light is very harsh.  You could try diffusing it with a piece of paper.  You could also try moving the light source slighty more forward of the subject.  <br/>The subject also seems a bit out of focus.</td>', 'the white light is very harsh.  You could try diffusing it with a piece of paper.  You could also try moving the light source slighty more forward of the subject.  The subject also seems a bit out of focus.', '2009-10-08 02:50:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(5679873, 826166, 108525, '<td valign="top">You could try shooting this shot at sunset/sunrise with a smidge of up lighting on the faces of the flowers.</td>', 'You could try shooting this shot at sunset/sunrise with a smidge of up lighting on the faces of the flowers.', '2009-10-08 02:51:35.000000', NULL, 1),
