(5680201, 825332, 101117, '<td valign="top">Nicely done, it''s like something straight out of a classic movie! The rain in the headlights make this shot, and the overall mood you have captured is great.</td>', 'Nicely done, it''s like something straight out of a classic movie! The rain in the headlights make this shot, and the overall mood you have captured is great.', '2009-10-08 08:31:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(5680206, 826157, 101117, '<td valign="top">Very nice colours and lighting here, I love the fact that you can just make out the outline but there is still enough important details there.</td>', 'Very nice colours and lighting here, I love the fact that you can just make out the outline but there is still enough important details there.', '2009-10-08 08:33:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(5680208, 826112, 101117, '<td valign="top">Very interesting abstract shot. I think I would like it more if it wasn''t for the line down the right hand side because apart from that everything is very smooth and airy, but the line lies in contrast to that being straight and defined.<br/> <br/>I feel I can make out three faces in the top of the white region, but it''s not quite clear if that''s what it is, so it keeps me looking and wondering.</td>', 'Very interesting abstract shot. I think I would like it more if it wasn''t for the line down the right hand side because apart from that everything is very smooth and airy, but the line lies in contrast to that being straight and defined. I feel I can make out three faces in the top of the white region, but it''s not quite clear if that''s what it is, so it keeps me looking and wondering.', '2009-10-08 08:36:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(5680209, 826230, 101117, '<td valign="top">Not really a low key look for me, it''s more black on black done in black and white. The shot itself while being sharp and clear, doesn''t have too much to hold my attention.</td>', 'Not really a low key look for me, it''s more black on black done in black and white. The shot itself while being sharp and clear, doesn''t have too much to hold my attention.', '2009-10-08 08:39:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(5680210, 825978, 101117, '<td valign="top">Nice effect with the lights, but I don''t think there''s enough overall interest in the visible details to justify all the black area. I know the idea is low key, but I think for it to work the darkness has to add to the shot, and here it just feels like extra space.</td>', 'Nice effect with the lights, but I don''t think there''s enough overall interest in the visible details to justify all the black area. I know the idea is low key, but I think for it to work the darkness has to add to the shot, and here it just feels like extra space.', '2009-10-08 08:40:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(5680212, 825438, 101117, '<td valign="top">Heh, like the title, and the concept as well, but it''s a little let down by the lighting for me. I do like the fade to black on the left side, but the harsh white spot on the orange takes a lot away.</td>', 'Heh, like the title, and the concept as well, but it''s a little let down by the lighting for me. I do like the fade to black on the left side, but the harsh white spot on the orange takes a lot away.', '2009-10-08 08:42:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(5680213, 825506, 101117, '<td valign="top">Very well done. You have managed to do here what a lot of the shots have missed, and that is make effective use of the black space! Very well composed and lit, like it a lot!</td>', 'Very well done. You have managed to do here what a lot of the shots have missed, and that is make effective use of the black space! Very well composed and lit, like it a lot!', '2009-10-08 08:44:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(5680214, 826094, 101117, '<td valign="top">I never find flora to be the best subject for B&amp;W, and particularly not low key. I always feel that the colours are too vibrant and rich to be converted to B&amp;W and it just leaves the shots feeling lacklustre.</td>', 'I never find flora to be the best subject for B&W, and particularly not low key. I always feel that the colours are too vibrant and rich to be converted to B&W and it just leaves the shots feeling lacklustre.', '2009-10-08 08:45:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(5680218, 826084, 101117, '<td valign="top">Very nicely done, this is the sort of shot that naturally works well in low key. I think you have done a very good job with the lighting here, and the black space works well. One of my favourites so far, and my first 10.</td>', 'Very nicely done, this is the sort of shot that naturally works well in low key. I think you have done a very good job with the lighting here, and the black space works well. One of my favourites so far, and my first 10.', '2009-10-08 08:46:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(5680221, 825117, 101117, '<td valign="top">Not really what I would consider low key since the whole central area of the shot is well lit and bright and clear. Nice shot otherwise though.</td>', 'Not really what I would consider low key since the whole central area of the shot is well lit and bright and clear. Nice shot otherwise though.', '2009-10-08 08:50:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(5680223, 825419, 101117, '<td valign="top">This is nice but the large lamp in the foreground is ruining it for me. I think perhaps a change in composition to make it less of a central component would have helped loads.</td>', 'This is nice but the large lamp in the foreground is ruining it for me. I think perhaps a change in composition to make it less of a central component would have helped loads.', '2009-10-08 08:51:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(5680224, 825125, 101117, '<td valign="top">I really like the lower half of this shot, but in contrast to that I really don''t like the clouds. They feel way to processed and actually look plastic or like they have been added on afterwards.</td>', 'I really like the lower half of this shot, but in contrast to that I really don''t like the clouds. They feel way to processed and actually look plastic or like they have been added on afterwards.', '2009-10-08 08:53:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(5680225, 826147, 101117, '<td valign="top">I feel this is a little let down by the very central light. The shot is otherwise nice, I think a change of composition would really help here.</td>', 'I feel this is a little let down by the very central light. The shot is otherwise nice, I think a change of composition would really help here.', '2009-10-08 08:54:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(5680229, 826116, 101117, '<td valign="top">I like this, it feels like something sinister is going on! The lone figure and the single strong light give it a very mysterious feel. I''m not sure about the area at the top though, I actually like the shot better when that part is covered up!</td>', 'I like this, it feels like something sinister is going on! The lone figure and the single strong light give it a very mysterious feel. I''m not sure about the area at the top though, I actually like the shot better when that part is covered up!', '2009-10-08 08:55:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(5680231, 826018, 101117, '<td valign="top">This doesn''t work well in low key, and actually just feels like a day time shot that''s underexposed. I think it''s a nice looking scene (what I can make out of it) and might work better if lit well and in a different challenge.</td>', 'This doesn''t work well in low key, and actually just feels like a day time shot that''s underexposed. I think it''s a nice looking scene (what I can make out of it) and might work better if lit well and in a different challenge.', '2009-10-08 08:57:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(5680232, 825974, 101117, '<td valign="top">The concept is good here, and in general I like the lighting and composition, but what''s really putting me off is his expression, he looks a cross between bored and posing for a completely different style of photo!</td>', 'The concept is good here, and in general I like the lighting and composition, but what''s really putting me off is his expression, he looks a cross between bored and posing for a completely different style of photo!', '2009-10-08 08:59:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(5680234, 825630, 101117, '<td valign="top">Ehh, I don''t really know what I''m looking at here, if I were to guess I would say it''s a table top sitting next to a wall. I don''t have anything against abstract but I really don''t think this works!</td>', 'Ehh, I don''t really know what I''m looking at here, if I were to guess I would say it''s a table top sitting next to a wall. I don''t have anything against abstract but I really don''t think this works!', '2009-10-08 09:02:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(5680237, 825098, 101117, '<td valign="top">Not really the kind of shot that works well in low key, you expect it to be vibrant and be able to see all the little details.</td>', 'Not really the kind of shot that works well in low key, you expect it to be vibrant and be able to see all the little details.', '2009-10-08 09:03:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(5680238, 826155, 101117, '<td valign="top">Nice low key shot. Makes me feel like there is something going on here, like she is waiting for something or watching something. Don''t particularly like the border here. I think if you had to add a border a simple black one would have worked better, though of course if you had done that you would probably be DQ''d for attempting to alter the shot.</td>', 'Nice low key shot. Makes me feel like there is something going on here, like she is waiting for something or watching something. Don''t particularly like the border here. I think if you had to add a border a simple black one would have worked better, though of course if you had done that you would probably be DQ''d for attempting to alter the shot.', '2009-10-08 09:05:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(5680240, 825551, 101117, '<td valign="top">Feels like something out of a magical fairytale land! I expect little people to come running into the scene any second and shelter under the mushrooms from the evil flying creatures!</td>', 'Feels like something out of a magical fairytale land! I expect little people to come running into the scene any second and shelter under the mushrooms from the evil flying creatures!', '2009-10-08 09:06:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(5680250, 825332, 86045, '<td valign="top">nice, I love the rain-reflection in the lights!</td>', 'nice, I love the rain-reflection in the lights!', '2009-10-08 09:33:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(5680364, 826090, 110292, '<td valign="top">Meets Challenge: 3 of 3.<br/>Technical: 3 of 3.  I''ll let that poor lone white pixel slide... this time. :)<br/>Emotion: 3 of 3. Such a great moment in time captured and shared with me. I keep expecting that drop to disappear, and it stays there. He''s unique, not like his brothers below him. Something we all aspire to be.<br/>Awe: 1 of 1.<br/> <br/>Fantastic. Fan. Tastic.</td>', 'Meets Challenge: 3 of 3.Technical: 3 of 3.  I''ll let that poor lone white pixel slide... this time. :)Emotion: 3 of 3. Such a great moment in time captured and shared with me. I keep expecting that drop to disappear, and it stays there. He''s unique, not like his brothers below him. Something we all aspire to be.Awe: 1 of 1. Fantastic. Fan. Tastic.', '2009-10-08 10:51:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(5680371, 825409, 108580, '<td valign="top">Natural looking colours and good tones on petals. Focus on landing pad just right. Pity the twig and leaf top right threw my attention from the flower.</td>', 'Natural looking colours and good tones on petals. Focus on landing pad just right. Pity the twig and leaf top right threw my attention from the flower.', '2009-10-08 10:55:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(5680434, 825098, 44786, '<td valign="top">This one I think is great.</td>', 'This one I think is great.', '2009-10-08 11:46:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(5680435, 825506, 44786, '<td valign="top">I like this one alot, must have been hard getting him to pose.</td>', 'I like this one alot, must have been hard getting him to pose.', '2009-10-08 11:46:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(5680454, 825923, 83845, '<td valign="top">One of my favorites so far in the challenge, but the horse on the left is a little flattened from blending into the black background.  I would give it a square crop that just includes the two horses on the right.</td>', 'One of my favorites so far in the challenge, but the horse on the left is a little flattened from blending into the black background.  I would give it a square crop that just includes the two horses on the right.', '2009-10-08 12:20:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(5680460, 825950, 83845, '<td valign="top">I tried taking a picture of a bubble once... not easy!  They won''t stay still!</td>', 'I tried taking a picture of a bubble once... not easy!  They won''t stay still!', '2009-10-08 12:29:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(5680463, 825840, 99263, '<td valign="top">Model has lovely legs but this is nowhere near low-key.</td>', 'Model has lovely legs but this is nowhere near low-key.', '2009-10-08 12:36:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(5680481, 826053, 83544, '<td valign="top">Amazing photo, I hope to see it in top 10</td>', 'Amazing photo, I hope to see it in top 10', '2009-10-08 13:08:16.000000', NULL, 1),
