(5680490, 825874, 83544, '<td valign="top">wow nice capture, these kind of photos always remind me of pink floyd - "the dark side of the moon" and "Wish you were here" :)</td>', 'wow nice capture, these kind of photos always remind me of pink floyd - "the dark side of the moon" and "Wish you were here" :)', '2009-10-08 13:13:45.000000', NULL, 1),
