(5681139, 825544, 110292, '<td valign="top">Meets Challenge: 1 of 3. I don''t think this is lowkey. At least, not enough for me.  I''d have preferred some highlights of key features of the dog, not a full-on face in full light.<br/>Technical: 2 of 3. Good focus and color, but there''s a lot of empty space to the right.  Maybe a little less.<br/>Emotion: 1 of 3. It''s a cute dog, but this shot''s not saying anything to me.  There''s no action, no struggle, no interest.<br/>Awe: 0 of 1.</td>', 'Meets Challenge: 1 of 3. I don''t think this is lowkey. At least, not enough for me.  I''d have preferred some highlights of key features of the dog, not a full-on face in full light.Technical: 2 of 3. Good focus and color, but there''s a lot of empty space to the right.  Maybe a little less.Emotion: 1 of 3. It''s a cute dog, but this shot''s not saying anything to me.  There''s no action, no struggle, no interest.Awe: 0 of 1.', '2009-10-08 22:24:38.000000', NULL, 1),
