(5681184, 826062, 110292, '<td valign="top">Meets Challenge: 3 of 3.  The blue corner is a bit bright, but it''s fine.<br/>Technical: 2 of 3. I wish the rear hand was either more visible or not at all.  Just those two finger tips is slightly distracting. The DoF is good and I like the lighting.<br/>Emotion: 2 of 3. Makes me think of all the recent riots.  The hand up close really gives a sense of action and stress.<br/>Awe: 0 of 1.</td>', 'Meets Challenge: 3 of 3.  The blue corner is a bit bright, but it''s fine.Technical: 2 of 3. I wish the rear hand was either more visible or not at all.  Just those two finger tips is slightly distracting. The DoF is good and I like the lighting.Emotion: 2 of 3. Makes me think of all the recent riots.  The hand up close really gives a sense of action and stress.Awe: 0 of 1.', '2009-10-08 22:43:59.000000', NULL, 1),
