(5682243, 825874, 96614, '<td valign="top">Nice catch of the moon!</td>', 'Nice catch of the moon!', '2009-10-09 22:57:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(5682251, 825835, 110292, '<td valign="top">Meets Challenge: 1 of 3. To me, this is just an underexposed shot, not a low key shot where highlights and darkness mingle to show your subject.<br/>Technical: 1 of 3. As underexposed shots go, the graininess in the dark areas are way too noticeable. This is probably due to how you went from color to B&amp;W<br/>Emotion: 1 of 3. I''m not trying to pick on your model, but she doesn''t look depressed so much as bored out of her mind.  I think it''s the raised eyebrow.  I realize there''s a fine line, facially, between depression (don''t want to do anything) and boredom (nothing to do), but still.<br/>Awe: 0 of 1.</td>', 'Meets Challenge: 1 of 3. To me, this is just an underexposed shot, not a low key shot where highlights and darkness mingle to show your subject.Technical: 1 of 3. As underexposed shots go, the graininess in the dark areas are way too noticeable. This is probably due to how you went from color to B&WEmotion: 1 of 3. I''m not trying to pick on your model, but she doesn''t look depressed so much as bored out of her mind.  I think it''s the raised eyebrow.  I realize there''s a fine line, facially, between depression (don''t want to do anything) and boredom (nothing to do), but still.Awe: 0 of 1.', '2009-10-09 23:27:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(5682253, 825871, 110292, '<td valign="top">Meets Challenge: 2 of 3. The extra light reflections are a bit too bright.  Maybe a tighter crop on the boat (which I assume is your main subject) would fix this.<br/>Technical: 1 of 3. The transitions from black to grey are pretty harsh (especially in the top third of the photo). The details in the water aren''t sharp enough to make out, but aren''t blurry enough to ignore.  Since it''s water, consider a longer exposure to further blur the reflection so I can focus more on the boat. Also, as above, crop in on the boat, that''s the important part.<br/>Emotion: 2 of 3. I actually built a boat very similar to that out of plywood, 2x4s and fiberglass cloth. I was so worried the first time I pushed it off the trailer into the water. Luckily, though, it floated just fine, much like this little boat. I bet the owner enjoys it as much as I did mine.<br/>Awe: 0 of 1.</td>', 'Meets Challenge: 2 of 3. The extra light reflections are a bit too bright.  Maybe a tighter crop on the boat (which I assume is your main subject) would fix this.Technical: 1 of 3. The transitions from black to grey are pretty harsh (especially in the top third of the photo). The details in the water aren''t sharp enough to make out, but aren''t blurry enough to ignore.  Since it''s water, consider a longer exposure to further blur the reflection so I can focus more on the boat. Also, as above, crop in on the boat, that''s the important part.Emotion: 2 of 3. I actually built a boat very similar to that out of plywood, 2x4s and fiberglass cloth. I was so worried the first time I pushed it off the trailer into the water. Luckily, though, it floated just fine, much like this little boat. I bet the owner enjoys it as much as I did mine.Awe: 0 of 1.', '2009-10-09 23:33:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(5682257, 825743, 110292, '<td valign="top">Meets Challenge: 3 of 3.  I could stand a little less "full coverage" light, and more spot lighting, but I know this isn''t a studio, so it''s fine.<br/>Technical: 2 of 3. I''d suggest a tighter crop, maybe? That phone booth isn''t really doing anything for the shot, so maybe just bumping the left edge in until it''s gone?  Otherwise, pretty good.<br/>Emotion: 3 of 3. A dark street corner, a guy with a cigarette leaning against the corner of a building looking for someone... does it get any more dramatic than that?  Very nice.<br/>Awe: 0 of 1.</td>', 'Meets Challenge: 3 of 3.  I could stand a little less "full coverage" light, and more spot lighting, but I know this isn''t a studio, so it''s fine.Technical: 2 of 3. I''d suggest a tighter crop, maybe? That phone booth isn''t really doing anything for the shot, so maybe just bumping the left edge in until it''s gone?  Otherwise, pretty good.Emotion: 3 of 3. A dark street corner, a guy with a cigarette leaning against the corner of a building looking for someone... does it get any more dramatic than that?  Very nice.Awe: 0 of 1.', '2009-10-09 23:39:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(5682260, 825672, 110292, '<td valign="top">Meets Challenge: 3 of 3.  Windshields are a bit bright, maybe this could have been taken later in the day? Risk losing the shiny grill though.. hmm...<br/>Technical: 3 of 3. Good focus, cropping, subjects, etc. Well done.<br/>Emotion: 2 of 3. You just know these cars are used to do dirty deeds.  No one needs *two* RRs unless they''re up to no good.<br/>Awe: 0 of 1. <br/> <br/>And yeah, if I saw those bad boys rolling down the street together, I''m *sure* I''d notice them.  Low Key they are not!</td>', 'Meets Challenge: 3 of 3.  Windshields are a bit bright, maybe this could have been taken later in the day? Risk losing the shiny grill though.. hmm...Technical: 3 of 3. Good focus, cropping, subjects, etc. Well done.Emotion: 2 of 3. You just know these cars are used to do dirty deeds.  No one needs *two* RRs unless they''re up to no good.Awe: 0 of 1.  And yeah, if I saw those bad boys rolling down the street together, I''m *sure* I''d notice them.  Low Key they are not!', '2009-10-09 23:43:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(5682261, 825886, 110292, '<td valign="top">Meets Challenge: 3 of 3. Very good!<br/>Technical: 3 of 3. I like the detail in the texture of the ground.  Glad it didn''t get lost. Maybe consider cropping the left side in a little, like 15% of the width?<br/>Emotion: 2 of 3. The title really helps the image (even though I''m probably not supposed to be judging the title). I like that "Lost" could be referring to the cross itself, or the person who so carelessly tossed it aside. <br/>Awe: 0 of 1.</td>', 'Meets Challenge: 3 of 3. Very good!Technical: 3 of 3. I like the detail in the texture of the ground.  Glad it didn''t get lost. Maybe consider cropping the left side in a little, like 15% of the width?Emotion: 2 of 3. The title really helps the image (even though I''m probably not supposed to be judging the title). I like that "Lost" could be referring to the cross itself, or the person who so carelessly tossed it aside. Awe: 0 of 1.', '2009-10-09 23:49:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(5682265, 826110, 110292, '<td valign="top">Meets Challenge: 1 of 3. Certainly a dark subject with a dark background, but this is basically just a poorly exposed photo.  To me, low key is where the deep darks and the few bright highlights work together to describe the subject. That''s not what this is.<br/>Technical: 2 of 3. A good crop. Love the head tilt. Shame the camera focused on the nose and the eyes are a bit blurry.<br/>Emotion: 2 of 3. My family had a dog when I was a kid, but it was a very active, hyper dog.  I never had the chance to live with a cool, mellow dog like this one appears to be.  I''m sure he''s a joy to live with.<br/>Awe: 0 of 1.</td>', 'Meets Challenge: 1 of 3. Certainly a dark subject with a dark background, but this is basically just a poorly exposed photo.  To me, low key is where the deep darks and the few bright highlights work together to describe the subject. That''s not what this is.Technical: 2 of 3. A good crop. Love the head tilt. Shame the camera focused on the nose and the eyes are a bit blurry.Emotion: 2 of 3. My family had a dog when I was a kid, but it was a very active, hyper dog.  I never had the chance to live with a cool, mellow dog like this one appears to be.  I''m sure he''s a joy to live with.Awe: 0 of 1.', '2009-10-09 23:54:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(5682287, 826089, 110292, '<td valign="top">Meets Challenge: 3 of 3. Great.<br/>Technical: 3 of 3. Good. Wish there was a little more lighting on his eye, just enough to bring out a glint.<br/>Emotion: 2 of 3. I wonder what he did?  I hope he''s forgiven.<br/>Awe: 0 of 1.</td>', 'Meets Challenge: 3 of 3. Great.Technical: 3 of 3. Good. Wish there was a little more lighting on his eye, just enough to bring out a glint.Emotion: 2 of 3. I wonder what he did?  I hope he''s forgiven.Awe: 0 of 1.', '2009-10-10 00:48:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(5682292, 825385, 110292, '<td valign="top">Meets Challenge: 0 of 3.  Way, way, way too bright. The lows in the tractor are completely gone.  I''d almost say this is high key.<br/>Technical: 3 of 3. But it''s a *great* shot.  There''s one unfortunate lens flare on the tractor, but that''s fine.<br/>Emotion: 3 of 3. My grand-dad grew up on a tobacco farm in South Carolina. He taught me to drive a tractor when I was a young kid.  I felt so responsible and trustworthy.  Only later did I realize he''d conned me into mowing almost 2 acres of grass.  Talk about a hard days work!<br/>Awe: 0 of 1.</td>', 'Meets Challenge: 0 of 3.  Way, way, way too bright. The lows in the tractor are completely gone.  I''d almost say this is high key.Technical: 3 of 3. But it''s a *great* shot.  There''s one unfortunate lens flare on the tractor, but that''s fine.Emotion: 3 of 3. My grand-dad grew up on a tobacco farm in South Carolina. He taught me to drive a tractor when I was a young kid.  I felt so responsible and trustworthy.  Only later did I realize he''d conned me into mowing almost 2 acres of grass.  Talk about a hard days work!Awe: 0 of 1.', '2009-10-10 00:55:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(5682297, 825388, 110292, '<td valign="top">Meets Challenge: 2 of 3.  It''s really close for me. I''d rather the flower be lit similarly to the stem.<br/>Technical: 3 of 3. A fine shot!<br/>Emotion: 1 of 3. The stem provides some amount of drama (its striking), but the flower is, well, just a flower. Not all that interesting, unfortunately.<br/>Awe: 0 of 1.</td>', 'Meets Challenge: 2 of 3.  It''s really close for me. I''d rather the flower be lit similarly to the stem.Technical: 3 of 3. A fine shot!Emotion: 1 of 3. The stem provides some amount of drama (its striking), but the flower is, well, just a flower. Not all that interesting, unfortunately.Awe: 0 of 1.', '2009-10-10 01:02:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(5682318, 826164, 110292, '<td valign="top">Meets Challenge: 3 of 3.<br/>Technical: 2 of 3. A few small things changed would have made this a better photo. Crop out the little piece of land on the left horizon, and crop up the bottom so the boat is in the middle of the shot.  Also, the stray pixels are pretty distracting on an otherwise solid color of water and sky.<br/>Emotion: 2 of 3.  I''ve always liked lone boats on the water, especially sail boats. This is a very calming shot.<br/>Awe: 0 of 1.</td>', 'Meets Challenge: 3 of 3.Technical: 2 of 3. A few small things changed would have made this a better photo. Crop out the little piece of land on the left horizon, and crop up the bottom so the boat is in the middle of the shot.  Also, the stray pixels are pretty distracting on an otherwise solid color of water and sky.Emotion: 2 of 3.  I''ve always liked lone boats on the water, especially sail boats. This is a very calming shot.Awe: 0 of 1.', '2009-10-10 01:16:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(5682326, 825425, 110292, '<td valign="top">Meets Challenge: 2 of 3. Not so much low key, to me, as just a dark shot with a white boat in it.  To me, low key is about how the darkness is augmented by the few highlights to describe the form of your subject. That''s not this.<br/>Technical: 2 of 3. A decent shot.  It''s a little grainy. That might just be because of the resize and jpg, though.<br/>Emotion: 2 of 3.<br/>Awe: 0 of 1.</td>', 'Meets Challenge: 2 of 3. Not so much low key, to me, as just a dark shot with a white boat in it.  To me, low key is about how the darkness is augmented by the few highlights to describe the form of your subject. That''s not this.Technical: 2 of 3. A decent shot.  It''s a little grainy. That might just be because of the resize and jpg, though.Emotion: 2 of 3.Awe: 0 of 1.', '2009-10-10 01:23:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(5682332, 825732, 110292, '<td valign="top">Meets Challenge: 3 of 3.<br/>Technical: 2 of 3. I think if this were taken later in the day, the opening might not have been so over blown, and you could have gotten a little more detail out there without sacrificing the texture inside.<br/>Emotion: 2 of 3.<br/>Awe: 0 of 1.</td>', 'Meets Challenge: 3 of 3.Technical: 2 of 3. I think if this were taken later in the day, the opening might not have been so over blown, and you could have gotten a little more detail out there without sacrificing the texture inside.Emotion: 2 of 3.Awe: 0 of 1.', '2009-10-10 01:26:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(5682335, 826075, 110292, '<td valign="top">Meets Challenge: 3 of 3.<br/>Technical: 2 of 3. For some reason, the moon doesn''t look round.  There appears to be a few gashes in its edge in the top left quadrant. I doubt that''s your fault, but it''s distracting.<br/>Emotion: 2 of 3.  That''s a good shot of the moon. Someone ominous, but not quite.<br/>Awe: 0 of 1.</td>', 'Meets Challenge: 3 of 3.Technical: 2 of 3. For some reason, the moon doesn''t look round.  There appears to be a few gashes in its edge in the top left quadrant. I doubt that''s your fault, but it''s distracting.Emotion: 2 of 3.  That''s a good shot of the moon. Someone ominous, but not quite.Awe: 0 of 1.', '2009-10-10 01:32:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(5682337, 826105, 110292, '<td valign="top">Meets Challenge: 2 of 3.  Actually a little too dark.  I can''t see any of the street''s form (except for the very bottom).<br/>Technical: 2 of 3.  There''s a lot of empty space up top, and for no real reason.  I''d have preferred a closer crop<br/>Emotion: 1 of 3. If I could see a little more, I might be able to relate emotionally to this picture, but it''s just really really dark. If there was someone in one of those windows, maybe.<br/>Awe: 0 of 1.</td>', 'Meets Challenge: 2 of 3.  Actually a little too dark.  I can''t see any of the street''s form (except for the very bottom).Technical: 2 of 3.  There''s a lot of empty space up top, and for no real reason.  I''d have preferred a closer cropEmotion: 1 of 3. If I could see a little more, I might be able to relate emotionally to this picture, but it''s just really really dark. If there was someone in one of those windows, maybe.Awe: 0 of 1.', '2009-10-10 01:35:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(5682341, 826210, 110292, '<td valign="top">Meets Challenge: 3 of 3.<br/>Technical: 3 of 3.<br/>Emotion: 2 of 3.  It''s a pretty dramatic shot, which I like, but I can''t quite tell if he''s praying, or getting ready for a fight.<br/>Awe: 0 of 1.</td>', 'Meets Challenge: 3 of 3.Technical: 3 of 3.Emotion: 2 of 3.  It''s a pretty dramatic shot, which I like, but I can''t quite tell if he''s praying, or getting ready for a fight.Awe: 0 of 1.', '2009-10-10 01:38:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(5682343, 826028, 110292, '<td valign="top">Meets Challenge: 1 of 3. To me, this is just a normal picture of a rose. Mostly full illumination, no real interaction between darks and highlights.<br/>Technical: 2 of 3. A decent shot.<br/>Emotion: 1 of 3. Flower shots usually don''t do it for me unless they are highly dramatic, and this just isn''t.<br/>Awe: 0 of 1.</td>', 'Meets Challenge: 1 of 3. To me, this is just a normal picture of a rose. Mostly full illumination, no real interaction between darks and highlights.Technical: 2 of 3. A decent shot.Emotion: 1 of 3. Flower shots usually don''t do it for me unless they are highly dramatic, and this just isn''t.Awe: 0 of 1.', '2009-10-10 01:41:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(5682348, 825809, 110292, '<td valign="top">Meets Challenge: 0 of 3. Sorry, this, to me, is definitely not low key. It''s a poorly exposed black and pink photo. I want to see darkness, with a few key highlights giving your subject form.<br/>Technical: 2 of 3. A pretty interesting composition. I actually like the lack of head and the dead flowers. I wish the jacket was a more properly exposed so I could see the details in it, and that the person''s hands were in focus.<br/>Emotion: 3 of 3.  What a creepy picture, though. I love it!<br/>Awe: 0 of 1.</td>', 'Meets Challenge: 0 of 3. Sorry, this, to me, is definitely not low key. It''s a poorly exposed black and pink photo. I want to see darkness, with a few key highlights giving your subject form.Technical: 2 of 3. A pretty interesting composition. I actually like the lack of head and the dead flowers. I wish the jacket was a more properly exposed so I could see the details in it, and that the person''s hands were in focus.Emotion: 3 of 3.  What a creepy picture, though. I love it!Awe: 0 of 1.', '2009-10-10 01:45:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(5682349, 825976, 110292, '<td valign="top">Meets Challenge: 2 of 3. Some parts of this shot are low key, but the lamp certainly isn''t. A better crop may have helped meet the challenge.<br/>Technical: 3 of 3. Well exposed, well focused.  The crop, from a technical standpoint, is good.<br/>Emotion: 3 of 3. Exuberance and Exasperation.  Very, very good!<br/>Awe: 0 of 1.</td>', 'Meets Challenge: 2 of 3. Some parts of this shot are low key, but the lamp certainly isn''t. A better crop may have helped meet the challenge.Technical: 3 of 3. Well exposed, well focused.  The crop, from a technical standpoint, is good.Emotion: 3 of 3. Exuberance and Exasperation.  Very, very good!Awe: 0 of 1.', '2009-10-10 01:48:24.000000', NULL, 1),
