(5682354, 825974, 110292, '<td valign="top">Meets Challenge: 2 of 3.  Upper left is a little too bright, but the gratuitously silver fingernails make up for it.  ;)<br/>Technical: 3 of 3.<br/>Emotion: 1 of 3. The guy''s face just about ruins it for me. It''s like he doesn''t even notice this hot vampire is about to bite him, or that she''s even there.  The girl is excellent, though. This shot had a lot of potential.<br/>Awe: 0 of 1.</td>', 'Meets Challenge: 2 of 3.  Upper left is a little too bright, but the gratuitously silver fingernails make up for it.  ;)Technical: 3 of 3.Emotion: 1 of 3. The guy''s face just about ruins it for me. It''s like he doesn''t even notice this hot vampire is about to bite him, or that she''s even there.  The girl is excellent, though. This shot had a lot of potential.Awe: 0 of 1.', '2009-10-10 01:56:35.000000', NULL, 1),
