(5682569, 825832, 100831, '<td valign="top">Nice candid!! I''d love to see the lips in color but it''s great in b/w too!! Great job with the contrast and smack on topic, imo. 8</td>', 'Nice candid!! I''d love to see the lips in color but it''s great in b/w too!! Great job with the contrast and smack on topic, imo. 8', '2009-10-10 11:30:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(5682570, 825657, 100831, '<td valign="top">Love it.... oh and I hope things go up from here....<br/> maybe a score would help. 8</td>', 'Love it.... oh and I hope things go up from here.... maybe a score would help. 8', '2009-10-10 11:31:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(5682592, 826176, 12674, '<td valign="top">Great shot!</td>', 'Great shot!', '2009-10-10 12:08:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(5682593, 825370, 12674, '<td valign="top">Perfect subject and subdued color!</td>', 'Perfect subject and subdued color!', '2009-10-10 12:09:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(5682627, 825551, 109363, '<td valign="top">stunning!</td>', 'stunning!', '2009-10-10 13:01:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(5682628, 825506, 109363, '<td valign="top">excellent lighting, texture, and mood.  a face only a mother could love ;)</td>', 'excellent lighting, texture, and mood.  a face only a mother could love ;)', '2009-10-10 13:01:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(5682631, 825385, 76335, '<td valign="top">Not really low key by my definition. Challenge aside, it''s a great shot.</td>', 'Not really low key by my definition. Challenge aside, it''s a great shot.', '2009-10-10 13:06:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(5682632, 826106, 76335, '<td valign="top">This needs more highlights or contrast to work. The low key, I''d say, hurts more than it helps the subject matter; it mutes an otherwise upbeat mood.</td>', 'This needs more highlights or contrast to work. The low key, I''d say, hurts more than it helps the subject matter; it mutes an otherwise upbeat mood.', '2009-10-10 13:08:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(5682633, 825686, 76335, '<td valign="top">Nicely composed. Great vignette.</td>', 'Nicely composed. Great vignette.', '2009-10-10 13:08:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(5682635, 826023, 76335, '<td valign="top">Surreal. I like the defocus/blur (though I''m sure others won''t).</td>', 'Surreal. I like the defocus/blur (though I''m sure others won''t).', '2009-10-10 13:09:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(5682650, 826190, 54054, '<td valign="top">I guess I''m not seeing it, but the background doesn''t distract me like some have mentioned. I think the waves set a contrast to the roundness of his face, making it subtly noticeable, low key if you will ;). I love this picture and I want that cat! <br/> <br/>Also, whoever said "boss" I think I see what you mean!</td>', 'I guess I''m not seeing it, but the background doesn''t distract me like some have mentioned. I think the waves set a contrast to the roundness of his face, making it subtly noticeable, low key if you will ;). I love this picture and I want that cat!  Also, whoever said "boss" I think I see what you mean!', '2009-10-10 13:58:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(5682674, 825329, 76335, '<td valign="top">Snapshotty, but I like it. Evokes thoughts of some late night study or work session -- burning the midnight oil. He seems very relaxed in the frame (it seems to be physically supporting him), and the grain works to good effect. Great.</td>', 'Snapshotty, but I like it. Evokes thoughts of some late night study or work session -- burning the midnight oil. He seems very relaxed in the frame (it seems to be physically supporting him), and the grain works to good effect. Great.', '2009-10-10 14:48:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(5682675, 826110, 76335, '<td valign="top">Good. I wonder if a square crop would have been more interesting.</td>', 'Good. I wonder if a square crop would have been more interesting.', '2009-10-10 14:48:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(5682676, 826198, 76335, '<td valign="top">Effective lighting and very moving.</td>', 'Effective lighting and very moving.', '2009-10-10 14:49:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(5682679, 825425, 76335, '<td valign="top">This will easily be one of my top picks. The midnight blue tones and grain and vignette are all perfect. The sailboat is placed smartly in the frame -- the position, size and angle are just right. Nicely composed and executed.</td>', 'This will easily be one of my top picks. The midnight blue tones and grain and vignette are all perfect. The sailboat is placed smartly in the frame -- the position, size and angle are just right. Nicely composed and executed.', '2009-10-10 14:53:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(5682680, 825581, 76335, '<td valign="top">Beautifully done.</td>', 'Beautifully done.', '2009-10-10 14:53:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(5682681, 826158, 76335, '<td valign="top">Great lighting. The wrinkled shirt and sunglasses are to good effect.</td>', 'Great lighting. The wrinkled shirt and sunglasses are to good effect.', '2009-10-10 14:54:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(5682751, 825894, 83313, '<td valign="top">Might have had more impact on me if the angle was slightly different so that the light behind the curtain was behind the person''s head. As it is, it draws my eye to their kneecap as the focal point of the scene.</td>', 'Might have had more impact on me if the angle was slightly different so that the light behind the curtain was behind the person''s head. As it is, it draws my eye to their kneecap as the focal point of the scene.', '2009-10-10 17:00:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(5682753, 826201, 83313, '<td valign="top">Not sure if this is low key or just darkened. I feel the highlights could use a little more contrast against the dark background.</td>', 'Not sure if this is low key or just darkened. I feel the highlights could use a little more contrast against the dark background.', '2009-10-10 17:01:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(5682758, 825965, 83313, '<td valign="top">Has some elements of low key, though it appears to be a broad daylight shot that was darkened a bit. However, I''m not totally sure of what low key is anymore. I thought I had it defined before this challenge.</td>', 'Has some elements of low key, though it appears to be a broad daylight shot that was darkened a bit. However, I''m not totally sure of what low key is anymore. I thought I had it defined before this challenge.', '2009-10-10 17:04:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(5682759, 826144, 83313, '<td valign="top">I like it, though it seems a bit oversharpened to me.</td>', 'I like it, though it seems a bit oversharpened to me.', '2009-10-10 17:06:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(5682764, 826166, 83313, '<td valign="top">Not really hitting my concept of low key, but I am being flexible with this challenge.</td>', 'Not really hitting my concept of low key, but I am being flexible with this challenge.', '2009-10-10 17:10:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(5682766, 825425, 83313, '<td valign="top">Has a bit of vignetting that you might get DQ''d for under basic editing rules. Unless it was shot that way. Aside from pointing that out, I like this simple composition.</td>', 'Has a bit of vignetting that you might get DQ''d for under basic editing rules. Unless it was shot that way. Aside from pointing that out, I like this simple composition.', '2009-10-10 17:12:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(5682767, 826157, 104537, '<td valign="top">Love this one, the tones and the compostion is outstanding.</td>', 'Love this one, the tones and the compostion is outstanding.', '2009-10-10 17:13:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(5682769, 825553, 104537, '<td valign="top">This is amazing, wonderful use of light, perfect capture of a loving moment.</td>', 'This is amazing, wonderful use of light, perfect capture of a loving moment.', '2009-10-10 17:14:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(5682773, 825672, 83313, '<td valign="top">I''m afraid this does not stike me as low key. It comes off to me as a bright daylight shot that has been darkened and had some strong contrast thrown at it. This has admittedly been a difficult subject to define.</td>', 'I''m afraid this does not stike me as low key. It comes off to me as a bright daylight shot that has been darkened and had some strong contrast thrown at it. This has admittedly been a difficult subject to define.', '2009-10-10 17:18:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(5682775, 825877, 104537, '<td valign="top">This is great, such a nostalgic  feel.</td>', 'This is great, such a nostalgic  feel.', '2009-10-10 17:18:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(5682778, 825117, 83313, '<td valign="top">I like this, though I am not sure whether to define this as low key or not. This has been a difficult thing to define, so it gets the benefit of the doubt.</td>', 'I like this, though I am not sure whether to define this as low key or not. This has been a difficult thing to define, so it gets the benefit of the doubt.', '2009-10-10 17:19:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(5682779, 826229, 104537, '<td valign="top">Wonderful smile, great use of light.</td>', 'Wonderful smile, great use of light.', '2009-10-10 17:20:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(5682781, 826142, 104537, '<td valign="top">Wonderful compostion, very moody and dramatic.</td>', 'Wonderful compostion, very moody and dramatic.', '2009-10-10 17:21:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(5682782, 825840, 83313, '<td valign="top">I''m really having difficulty seeing how this fits the definition of low key. Perhaps my own definition is too restrictive? I do like it, however.</td>', 'I''m really having difficulty seeing how this fits the definition of low key. Perhaps my own definition is too restrictive? I do like it, however.', '2009-10-10 17:22:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(5682784, 826188, 83313, '<td valign="top">Nice balancing act. Makes me look twice.</td>', 'Nice balancing act. Makes me look twice.', '2009-10-10 17:22:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(5682787, 826188, 104537, '<td valign="top">Beautiful</td>', 'Beautiful', '2009-10-10 17:26:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(5682788, 826149, 83313, '<td valign="top">Comes off to me as a snapshot, and not really low key. Just a bit dim. Sorry.</td>', 'Comes off to me as a snapshot, and not really low key. Just a bit dim. Sorry.', '2009-10-10 17:26:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(5682789, 825551, 104537, '<td valign="top">Great use of light, love the background.</td>', 'Great use of light, love the background.', '2009-10-10 17:27:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(5682790, 825584, 83313, '<td valign="top">Nice use of shallow DOF and lots of visual impact.</td>', 'Nice use of shallow DOF and lots of visual impact.', '2009-10-10 17:28:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(5682792, 825517, 104537, '<td valign="top">Outstanding detail.</td>', 'Outstanding detail.', '2009-10-10 17:29:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(5682793, 825976, 104537, '<td valign="top">Love this one, such a cute shot, great use of light and the compostion is perfect.</td>', 'Love this one, such a cute shot, great use of light and the compostion is perfect.', '2009-10-10 17:30:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(5682794, 825966, 104537, '<td valign="top">Love the mood this image sets, such a serene shot. The use of light to cast the water reflection just adds to the beauty of this image. 10</td>', 'Love the mood this image sets, such a serene shot. The use of light to cast the water reflection just adds to the beauty of this image. 10', '2009-10-10 17:30:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(5682796, 826090, 104537, '<td valign="top">Outstanding</td>', 'Outstanding', '2009-10-10 17:32:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(5682798, 826112, 83313, '<td valign="top">I expect this one to get slammed in voting. It does meet the challenge topic, however, and I find the abstractness to be appealing. Appears to possibly be the same object as another entry that photographed it far differently.</td>', 'I expect this one to get slammed in voting. It does meet the challenge topic, however, and I find the abstractness to be appealing. Appears to possibly be the same object as another entry that photographed it far differently.', '2009-10-10 17:35:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(5682799, 826144, 104537, '<td valign="top">Wonderful light, perfect focus.</td>', 'Wonderful light, perfect focus.', '2009-10-10 17:35:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(5682800, 826212, 83313, '<td valign="top">Excellent use of lighting to highlight the important parts of the subject. Hope you left some notes, especially regarding how you lit it. I''ll be interested in finding out whose this is.</td>', 'Excellent use of lighting to highlight the important parts of the subject. Hope you left some notes, especially regarding how you lit it. I''ll be interested in finding out whose this is.', '2009-10-10 17:36:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(5682801, 826170, 83313, '<td valign="top">Just comes off to me as a shot that has been darkened a bit. I like semi abstract views of cars, but aside from the challenge topic, this just is not impacting me much, I''m afraid.</td>', 'Just comes off to me as a shot that has been darkened a bit. I like semi abstract views of cars, but aside from the challenge topic, this just is not impacting me much, I''m afraid.', '2009-10-10 17:38:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(5682802, 825329, 83313, '<td valign="top">He''d better stay away from my beer. Certainly low key, by my understanding of the concept, but just comes off as a snapshot to me.</td>', 'He''d better stay away from my beer. Certainly low key, by my understanding of the concept, but just comes off as a snapshot to me.', '2009-10-10 17:40:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(5682849, 826074, 99263, '<td valign="top">Lovely reflections and well executed image.</td>', 'Lovely reflections and well executed image.', '2009-10-10 19:02:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(5682918, 826189, 83313, '<td valign="top">Looks like a nice peaceful evening.<br/> <br/><strike>Guessing this is a <img alt="'' . substr(''//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/21_F.gif'', strrpos(''//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/21_F.gif'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/21_F.gif"/> <a href="//www.dpchallenge.com/profile.php?USER_ID=106349" rel="nofollow" target="_blank">Tammster</a> entry. If you had not had the location in your title, I would have had no idea whose it was.</strike> Disregard, I forgot that I was already aware of which was her entry.</td>', 'Looks like a nice peaceful evening. Guessing this is a  Tammster entry. If you had not had the location in your title, I would have had no idea whose it was. Disregard, I forgot that I was already aware of which was her entry.', '2009-10-10 20:32:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(5682943, 826166, 76335, '<td valign="top">I love the composition. Would like to have seen it shot in more subdued lighting -- dawn or dusk -- or even with a flash.</td>', 'I love the composition. Would like to have seen it shot in more subdued lighting -- dawn or dusk -- or even with a flash.', '2009-10-10 21:11:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(5682946, 826064, 76335, '<td valign="top">I love ths sky; the ground is dead weight though. I wonder if cropping it out would have given this more impact.</td>', 'I love ths sky; the ground is dead weight though. I wonder if cropping it out would have given this more impact.', '2009-10-10 21:13:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(5682947, 825790, 76335, '<td valign="top">Would like to see it sharper.</td>', 'Would like to see it sharper.', '2009-10-10 21:13:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(5682948, 826176, 76335, '<td valign="top">Powerful rhythm and simply stunning in this low key treatment.</td>', 'Powerful rhythm and simply stunning in this low key treatment.', '2009-10-10 21:14:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(5682949, 825948, 76335, '<td valign="top">Great long exposure work -- the sky is especially nice.</td>', 'Great long exposure work -- the sky is especially nice.', '2009-10-10 21:14:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(5682957, 826220, 76335, '<td valign="top">Neat idea, but needs a little more light or contrast (not much). There''s not enough definition to identify these as garbage cans -- not without a good look anyway, and that''s something that most voters here won''t afford you.</td>', 'Neat idea, but needs a little more light or contrast (not much). There''s not enough definition to identify these as garbage cans -- not without a good look anyway, and that''s something that most voters here won''t afford you.', '2009-10-10 21:18:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(5682959, 826160, 76335, '<td valign="top">A stunningly simple still life. Great idea.</td>', 'A stunningly simple still life. Great idea.', '2009-10-10 21:20:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(5682960, 825297, 76335, '<td valign="top">Great studio work here. It''s as much a character study as it is anything about the tattoo.</td>', 'Great studio work here. It''s as much a character study as it is anything about the tattoo.', '2009-10-10 21:20:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(5682961, 825629, 76335, '<td valign="top">Great use of negative space and soft focus. Has a real air of mystery.</td>', 'Great use of negative space and soft focus. Has a real air of mystery.', '2009-10-10 21:21:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(5682962, 825995, 76335, '<td valign="top">Nice portrait. I like how the pinstripes fade to black.</td>', 'Nice portrait. I like how the pinstripes fade to black.', '2009-10-10 21:22:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(5682964, 826189, 76335, '<td valign="top">Quite stunning in its simplicity. Very nice.</td>', 'Quite stunning in its simplicity. Very nice.', '2009-10-10 21:22:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(5682970, 825835, 76335, '<td valign="top">Reminds me of one of the bus billboards I often see encouraging anyone with a psychological condition (alcoholism, depression, addiction, etc.) to participate in a university study. Anecdote aside, the darkness and soft focus enhance your message. Good job.</td>', 'Reminds me of one of the bus billboards I often see encouraging anyone with a psychological condition (alcoholism, depression, addiction, etc.) to participate in a university study. Anecdote aside, the darkness and soft focus enhance your message. Good job.', '2009-10-10 21:27:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(5683054, 826143, 76335, '<td valign="top">Great portrait and very effective lighting. Any more though, and I''m not sure it would be low key. But it works for me.</td>', 'Great portrait and very effective lighting. Any more though, and I''m not sure it would be low key. But it works for me.', '2009-10-10 23:38:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(5683059, 825701, 83313, '<td valign="top">I had expected you to fit Clark in with the keys hanging in his ignition. The high key and the low key. This works too.</td>', 'I had expected you to fit Clark in with the keys hanging in his ignition. The high key and the low key. This works too.', '2009-10-11 00:01:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(5683060, 826100, 83313, '<td valign="top">I can''t even figure out what I am looking at. I will treat it as an abstract.</td>', 'I can''t even figure out what I am looking at. I will treat it as an abstract.', '2009-10-11 00:03:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(5683062, 826208, 83313, '<td valign="top">There is a hint of artifacts showing in some of the facial details and around the edges of the shoulders. Your 85k file size says these artifacts are from using too much JPEG compression. Compression kills detail. Always use the least compression you can get away with and still come in under challenge limits. Otherwise, this is a nicely done selfie.</td>', 'There is a hint of artifacts showing in some of the facial details and around the edges of the shoulders. Your 85k file size says these artifacts are from using too much JPEG compression. Compression kills detail. Always use the least compression you can get away with and still come in under challenge limits. Otherwise, this is a nicely done selfie.', '2009-10-11 00:06:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(5683370, 826089, 76335, '<td valign="top">Good idea, though the thumb placement is a bit distracting -- looks like his lip at first glance.</td>', 'Good idea, though the thumb placement is a bit distracting -- looks like his lip at first glance.', '2009-10-11 11:32:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(5683371, 826230, 76335, '<td valign="top">It''s certainly a classic pose!</td>', 'It''s certainly a classic pose!', '2009-10-11 11:34:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(5683373, 825863, 76335, '<td valign="top">Excellent still life and great sepia tones here.</td>', 'Excellent still life and great sepia tones here.', '2009-10-11 11:35:21.000000', NULL, 1),
