(5683579, 825440, 83544, '<td valign="top">For a moment I tought that the bus is going towards the cars, but then it came to my mind that there it is driven on the oposite side :), nicely captured btw</td>', 'For a moment I tought that the bus is going towards the cars, but then it came to my mind that there it is driven on the oposite side :), nicely captured btw', '2009-10-11 16:32:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(5683582, 825657, 83544, '<td valign="top">Hmmm maybe you have made the photo too dark, the gun (I suppose that it''s a gun) can be barely seen and the title doesn''t seem right, maybe "A point of no return" sounds better, anyway I very much like your idea for this contest</td>', 'Hmmm maybe you have made the photo too dark, the gun (I suppose that it''s a gun) can be barely seen and the title doesn''t seem right, maybe "A point of no return" sounds better, anyway I very much like your idea for this contest', '2009-10-11 16:34:38.000000', NULL, 1),
