(5684588, 825956, 92545, '<td valign="top">I like the idea, but I think a deeper depth of field would have helped the entire feather to be in focus.  6</td>', 'I like the idea, but I think a deeper depth of field would have helped the entire feather to be in focus.  6', '2009-10-12 14:55:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(5684594, 826185, 92545, '<td valign="top">I''m sure there have been a lot of people commenting that they would have mirrored this in post processing.  I certainly won''t mark you down for it.  I love this as a low-key shot.  You captured great detail and I think it''s awesome that the camera is the subject and the mechanism for capture.  9</td>', 'I''m sure there have been a lot of people commenting that they would have mirrored this in post processing.  I certainly won''t mark you down for it.  I love this as a low-key shot.  You captured great detail and I think it''s awesome that the camera is the subject and the mechanism for capture.  9', '2009-10-12 15:01:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(5684596, 825835, 92545, '<td valign="top">This is low-key, but I think a secondary (even if it''s faint) light source might have given a bit more detail to her hair.  Also, the focus on her face could have been a bit sharper.  5</td>', 'This is low-key, but I think a secondary (even if it''s faint) light source might have given a bit more detail to her hair.  Also, the focus on her face could have been a bit sharper.  5', '2009-10-12 15:03:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(5684598, 825297, 92545, '<td valign="top">I love this.  The combination of silhouette and a standard light source make this amazing.  The border even adds to the effect.  I''m starting with a 9, but I may come back and bump this to a 10.</td>', 'I love this.  The combination of silhouette and a standard light source make this amazing.  The border even adds to the effect.  I''m starting with a 9, but I may come back and bump this to a 10.', '2009-10-12 15:04:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(5684600, 826065, 92545, '<td valign="top">I like the shot.  You preserved detail while shooting low-key.  I think I would have cropped some more off the top, though, to make it seem a bit more balanced.</td>', 'I like the shot.  You preserved detail while shooting low-key.  I think I would have cropped some more off the top, though, to make it seem a bit more balanced.', '2009-10-12 15:05:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(5684602, 826042, 92545, '<td valign="top">Wow!  I''m wondering how you shot this.  Great detail.  How on earth did you manage this background?  9</td>', 'Wow!  I''m wondering how you shot this.  Great detail.  How on earth did you manage this background?  9', '2009-10-12 15:06:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(5684605, 825743, 92545, '<td valign="top">Great shot.  I love everything about this.  Now to decide... 9 or 10.</td>', 'Great shot.  I love everything about this.  Now to decide... 9 or 10.', '2009-10-12 15:07:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(5684610, 826237, 92545, '<td valign="top">I''m not sure how this one will fair, due to the subject, but I really like it.  It''s not something I would have photographed and certainly not something I''m good at photographing, but I like the angle you used and how it just seems to fade into eternity.  8</td>', 'I''m not sure how this one will fair, due to the subject, but I really like it.  It''s not something I would have photographed and certainly not something I''m good at photographing, but I like the angle you used and how it just seems to fade into eternity.  8', '2009-10-12 15:12:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(5684615, 825976, 92545, '<td valign="top">Do I ever know that feeling.  :-)  Great photo too.  I love the gradual fade from right to left.  It leaves me wondering how many shots you had to take to get such a perfect look.  Love everything about this.  I''m not sure if it''s as "textbook" low-key as some of the other entries, but I certainly won''t mark you down for it.  10  I''d like to see a full-size version of this.  I hate how much detail has to go with DPC''s size requirements.</td>', 'Do I ever know that feeling.  :-)  Great photo too.  I love the gradual fade from right to left.  It leaves me wondering how many shots you had to take to get such a perfect look.  Love everything about this.  I''m not sure if it''s as "textbook" low-key as some of the other entries, but I certainly won''t mark you down for it.  10  I''d like to see a full-size version of this.  I hate how much detail has to go with DPC''s size requirements.', '2009-10-12 15:15:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(5684617, 825581, 92545, '<td valign="top">Simply beautiful.  I can''t decide if it''s just noisy or if grain was added.  Either way, it still works.  8</td>', 'Simply beautiful.  I can''t decide if it''s just noisy or if grain was added.  Either way, it still works.  8', '2009-10-12 15:17:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(5684618, 826170, 92545, '<td valign="top">I don''t really see this as low-key and I think the crop is a little jarring.  You certainly tried to take a difficult photo and make it fit in the challenge, but I think maybe an entirely different approach would have worked better.  On a side note, I would like to see the original of this, the colors are very nice.</td>', 'I don''t really see this as low-key and I think the crop is a little jarring.  You certainly tried to take a difficult photo and make it fit in the challenge, but I think maybe an entirely different approach would have worked better.  On a side note, I would like to see the original of this, the colors are very nice.', '2009-10-12 15:18:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(5684621, 825709, 92545, '<td valign="top">Gotta love those little water droplets.  You did a great job with this.  Very creative.  It''s a shot that I would have never thought of using in a low-key challenge, but you really made it work.  10</td>', 'Gotta love those little water droplets.  You did a great job with this.  Very creative.  It''s a shot that I would have never thought of using in a low-key challenge, but you really made it work.  10', '2009-10-12 15:21:30.000000', NULL, 1),
