(5685732, 826107, 76335, '<td valign="top">Great idea and dramatic lighting. Not sure about the center framing.</td>', 'Great idea and dramatic lighting. Not sure about the center framing.', '2009-10-13 17:39:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(5685733, 826028, 76335, '<td valign="top">Talk about fill the frame. Beautiful.</td>', 'Talk about fill the frame. Beautiful.', '2009-10-13 17:39:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(5685736, 826201, 76335, '<td valign="top">Certainly low key but at the expense of losing some definition. Great subject though.</td>', 'Certainly low key but at the expense of losing some definition. Great subject though.', '2009-10-13 17:40:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(5685738, 826167, 76335, '<td valign="top">Becky looks tired. Very effective portrait.</td>', 'Becky looks tired. Very effective portrait.', '2009-10-13 17:40:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(5685741, 826222, 76335, '<td valign="top">Nice sky but the foreground lacks definition. Some dodge and burn or perhaps experimenting with different channels might help.<br/> <br/>ETA: Basic editing -- no dodge and burn. Still some channel work perhaps... <br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2009-10-14 19:43:09.</i></td>', 'Nice sky but the foreground lacks definition. Some dodge and burn or perhaps experimenting with different channels might help. ETA: Basic editing -- no dodge and burn. Still some channel work perhaps... ', '2009-10-13 17:42:40.000000', '2009-10-14 20:43:09.000000', 1),
(5685742, 826190, 76335, '<td valign="top">Nicely done.</td>', 'Nicely done.', '2009-10-13 17:43:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(5685744, 826237, 76335, '<td valign="top">Beauitful and quite surprising in this low contrast, low key treatment. I might have cropped out the triangle in the lower left -- it tends to pull the eye away from the pattern.</td>', 'Beauitful and quite surprising in this low contrast, low key treatment. I might have cropped out the triangle in the lower left -- it tends to pull the eye away from the pattern.', '2009-10-13 17:45:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(5685745, 825883, 76335, '<td valign="top">Not sure I''d call it low key. Startling and original all the same.</td>', 'Not sure I''d call it low key. Startling and original all the same.', '2009-10-13 17:46:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(5685747, 825874, 76335, '<td valign="top">Completely unoriginal, but I''m so jealous of anyone that can pull off a lunar shot like this, that I can only score it high.</td>', 'Completely unoriginal, but I''m so jealous of anyone that can pull off a lunar shot like this, that I can only score it high.', '2009-10-13 17:47:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(5685748, 825440, 76335, '<td valign="top">The placement of Big Ben is perfect.</td>', 'The placement of Big Ben is perfect.', '2009-10-13 17:48:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(5685750, 826006, 76335, '<td valign="top">Nicely exposed. The tilt is imposing and effective.</td>', 'Nicely exposed. The tilt is imposing and effective.', '2009-10-13 17:49:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(5685752, 826105, 76335, '<td valign="top">I love the idea, but the negative space at the top doesn''t add much that I can see.</td>', 'I love the idea, but the negative space at the top doesn''t add much that I can see.', '2009-10-13 17:50:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(5685754, 825965, 76335, '<td valign="top">The caption is corny -- I love it.</td>', 'The caption is corny -- I love it.', '2009-10-13 17:50:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(5685756, 825332, 76335, '<td valign="top">Oh, how classic is this?! Excellent.</td>', 'Oh, how classic is this?! Excellent.', '2009-10-13 17:51:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(5685759, 826173, 76335, '<td valign="top">Great idea although the framing feels too tight, especially with the border which I think is unnecessary and maybe distracting.</td>', 'Great idea although the framing feels too tight, especially with the border which I think is unnecessary and maybe distracting.', '2009-10-13 17:54:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(5685824, 825910, 76335, '<td valign="top">Compositionally, it needs something more. Technically, it might be more effective in black and white.</td>', 'Compositionally, it needs something more. Technically, it might be more effective in black and white.', '2009-10-13 19:03:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(5685827, 825884, 76335, '<td valign="top">More mid-key than low-key. Still, it''s a great still life with some dramatic light and textures.</td>', 'More mid-key than low-key. Still, it''s a great still life with some dramatic light and textures.', '2009-10-13 19:04:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(5685830, 825877, 76335, '<td valign="top">Nicely lit and posed. Would like to see it sharper.</td>', 'Nicely lit and posed. Would like to see it sharper.', '2009-10-13 19:05:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(5685831, 825633, 76335, '<td valign="top">Not sure I''d call it low-key. Challenge aside, this is one of the more appealing picture I''ve seen in the challenge. It''s a fabulous composition and the colors are perfect.</td>', 'Not sure I''d call it low-key. Challenge aside, this is one of the more appealing picture I''ve seen in the challenge. It''s a fabulous composition and the colors are perfect.', '2009-10-13 19:07:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(5685832, 825832, 76335, '<td valign="top">Is there something on her lips? I can''t tell. I like the softness and the lighting. The lips need more light, though, to show us what''s there (lipstick? food?) or that there''s nothing there.</td>', 'Is there something on her lips? I can''t tell. I like the softness and the lighting. The lips need more light, though, to show us what''s there (lipstick? food?) or that there''s nothing there.', '2009-10-13 19:10:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(5685833, 826004, 76335, '<td valign="top">Lit by street lamp? More context or background would help.</td>', 'Lit by street lamp? More context or background would help.', '2009-10-13 19:11:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(5685835, 825740, 76335, '<td valign="top">Not really low key, just poorly lit.</td>', 'Not really low key, just poorly lit.', '2009-10-13 19:12:11.000000', NULL, 1),
