(5686639, 826173, 37529, '<td valign="top">Very nice.  I would have thought this would do better in the scoring.  Lighting is excellent, and composition with the "low key" exposure is effective as well.  The highlight of the red wine in the glass brings the eye to the center of the picture.  Well done.</td>', 'Very nice.  I would have thought this would do better in the scoring.  Lighting is excellent, and composition with the "low key" exposure is effective as well.  The highlight of the red wine in the glass brings the eye to the center of the picture.  Well done.', '2009-10-14 07:52:38.000000', NULL, 0),
