(5686700, 826042, 67152, '<td valign="top">Really well done - love the intensity this image gives off - i actually gave it a 7 because it just seemed a bit oversharpened in the feathers on first inspection.  This seems to happen to me as well with bird shots when I try to fit them into 640 and 150kb.  I would love to see this one in all its glory at full res - I am sure it is even more stunning.</td>', 'Really well done - love the intensity this image gives off - i actually gave it a 7 because it just seemed a bit oversharpened in the feathers on first inspection.  This seems to happen to me as well with bird shots when I try to fit them into 640 and 150kb.  I would love to see this one in all its glory at full res - I am sure it is even more stunning.', '2009-10-14 09:34:41.000000', NULL, 0),
