(5686852, 825630, 30861, '<td valign="top">You SO got robbed! From my perspective anyway. But it''s completely understandable, and I''m sure you expected your score to crater with this one, so I guess you entered it in the same spirit in which I enter many of mine. Congrats on a transcendent image :-)</td>', 'You SO got robbed! From my perspective anyway. But it''s completely understandable, and I''m sure you expected your score to crater with this one, so I guess you entered it in the same spirit in which I enter many of mine. Congrats on a transcendent image :-)', '2009-10-14 11:16:36.000000', NULL, 0),
