(5686858, 826209, 15711, '<td valign="top">I thought this was beautiful but didn''t vote.  I thought it was not "low key" enough for me, but didn''t think it was fair to vote down for something so lovely.</td>', 'I thought this was beautiful but didn''t vote.  I thought it was not "low key" enough for me, but didn''t think it was fair to vote down for something so lovely.', '2009-10-14 11:18:02.000000', NULL, 0),
