(5686950, 825136, 110294, '<td valign="top">I would like to thank all of you who voted on my image. I had a lot of fun on this challenge. <br/>This is a very tough group of extremely talented photographers. Thanks for all who entered and gave me even more inspiration to improve myself.<br/>Keep up the awesome work everyone.<br/>Dale</td>', 'I would like to thank all of you who voted on my image. I had a lot of fun on this challenge. This is a very tough group of extremely talented photographers. Thanks for all who entered and gave me even more inspiration to improve myself.Keep up the awesome work everyone.Dale', '2009-10-14 11:55:27.000000', NULL, 0),
(5687066, 825743, 24454, '<td valign="top">Not only a pretty good score -- its a darn good PHOTO!  Way to rub it in how effortless these types of street works of art are for you!   I hope you can come with us one day next week!   :)</td>', 'Not only a pretty good score -- its a darn good PHOTO!  Way to rub it in how effortless these types of street works of art are for you!   I hope you can come with us one day next week!   :)', '2009-10-14 12:59:40.000000', NULL, 0),
