(5687076, 825966, 24454, '<td valign="top">Mae, this is AWESOME!</td>', 'Mae, this is AWESOME!', '2009-10-14 13:01:42.000000', NULL, 0),
(5687081, 826080, 24454, '<td valign="top">Wow!  I LOVE this one.   I''m disappointed to not see it on the front page.  Its masterfully artful!</td>', 'Wow!  I LOVE this one.   I''m disappointed to not see it on the front page.  Its masterfully artful!', '2009-10-14 13:03:36.000000', NULL, 0),
(5687103, 826115, 30982, '<td valign="top">I always love seeing pictures of your hubby - he''s such a distinguished gentleman!  Low light suits his silver hair, too.  Don''t be afraid to crank the ISO and hit a bit higher shutter - grain won''t be bad and in fact will suit this.</td>', 'I always love seeing pictures of your hubby - he''s such a distinguished gentleman!  Low light suits his silver hair, too.  Don''t be afraid to crank the ISO and hit a bit higher shutter - grain won''t be bad and in fact will suit this.', '2009-10-14 13:15:22.000000', NULL, 0),
(5687110, 825125, 30982, '<td valign="top">Pretty darn impressive "fake" if you ask me!</td>', 'Pretty darn impressive "fake" if you ask me!', '2009-10-14 13:18:05.000000', NULL, 0),
(5687115, 826042, 106349, '<td valign="top">Excellent finish Andrew!! I really love this shot.</td>', 'Excellent finish Andrew!! I really love this shot.', '2009-10-14 13:24:12.000000', NULL, 0),
(5687117, 825630, 22537, '<td valign="top">This is very cool and very well done. At first, I''m looking at a the floor of a room and then I see the title and slowly the image transforms into an ocean. Very interesting indeed! ;-) Much like a chameleon. Yeah you got robbed but this is not a shot you look at for half a second and figure it out. It takes a few moments to "get it" and when you do, you feel like you are one of the few smart ones out there. ;-) Nice work!!</td>', 'This is very cool and very well done. At first, I''m looking at a the floor of a room and then I see the title and slowly the image transforms into an ocean. Very interesting indeed! ;-) Much like a chameleon. Yeah you got robbed but this is not a shot you look at for half a second and figure it out. It takes a few moments to "get it" and when you do, you feel like you are one of the few smart ones out there. ;-) Nice work!!', '2009-10-14 13:24:26.000000', NULL, 0),
(5687120, 825517, 100831, '<td valign="top">I love the golden tone, caused by the wonderfully done low key processing.<br/>Excellent macro.</td>', 'I love the golden tone, caused by the wonderfully done low key processing.Excellent macro.', '2009-10-14 13:24:59.000000', NULL, 0),
(5687127, 826028, 30861, '<td valign="top">Never woulda'' thought this was yours... I gave it a 7, I love the down-key, slightly decaying essence of it. Sorry it did so poorly for you :-(</td>', 'Never woulda'' thought this was yours... I gave it a 7, I love the down-key, slightly decaying essence of it. Sorry it did so poorly for you :-(', '2009-10-14 13:29:29.000000', NULL, 0),
(5687129, 826115, 106349, '<td valign="top">I am completely confused as to why this scored so low. It makes no sense why you would get so many 1s - 3s. It''s crazy... this is a great shot. Even if it''s a tiny bit blurry, it has SO much in it''s favor, including clearly meeting challenge.</td>', 'I am completely confused as to why this scored so low. It makes no sense why you would get so many 1s - 3s. It''s crazy... this is a great shot. Even if it''s a tiny bit blurry, it has SO much in it''s favor, including clearly meeting challenge.', '2009-10-14 13:33:10.000000', NULL, 0),
(5687131, 826189, 106349, '<td valign="top">This is one of the most unique shots in this challenge &amp; deserved a far better score. I think voters were clearly confused with voting on this one.</td>', 'This is one of the most unique shots in this challenge & deserved a far better score. I think voters were clearly confused with voting on this one.', '2009-10-14 13:34:14.000000', NULL, 0),
(5687133, 826120, 44786, '<td valign="top">Thanks for the nice comments, I really appreciate them.<br/>I am very pleased with the result of my first challenge.<br/> <br/>I had many outtakes for the challenge, and it was not my plan to submit a nude picture, but I just loved how this picture turned out, and the model also loved this picture the most. I knew it would get two or three 1´s in the voting because of the nude content, although I think it is very subtle and artistic.<br/> <br/>The amount of 1 votes did though surprice me, are there really some peoble that hate nude so much?? <br/>Thats sad if it´s the reason for the one´s.</td>', 'Thanks for the nice comments, I really appreciate them.I am very pleased with the result of my first challenge. I had many outtakes for the challenge, and it was not my plan to submit a nude picture, but I just loved how this picture turned out, and the model also loved this picture the most. I knew it would get two or three 1´s in the voting because of the nude content, although I think it is very subtle and artistic. The amount of 1 votes did though surprice me, are there really some peoble that hate nude so much?? Thats sad if it´s the reason for the one´s.', '2009-10-14 13:34:53.000000', NULL, 0),
(5687136, 826157, 106349, '<td valign="top">Funny how abstract just doesn''t work in some challenges. I like the way this came out. Good colors, good lighting (imo) and it clearly meets challenge. Should have scored better...</td>', 'Funny how abstract just doesn''t work in some challenges. I like the way this came out. Good colors, good lighting (imo) and it clearly meets challenge. Should have scored better...', '2009-10-14 13:37:11.000000', NULL, 0),
(5687149, 825893, 86447, '<td valign="top">I like the composition on this.   I''d really like to see a bit of a catchlight in the eye since it seems a bit lost in the darkness.  That''s hard to do in Low Key, I know... but always fun for me to have a goal to shoot for.  :)</td>', 'I like the composition on this.   I''d really like to see a bit of a catchlight in the eye since it seems a bit lost in the darkness.  That''s hard to do in Low Key, I know... but always fun for me to have a goal to shoot for.  :)', '2009-10-14 13:47:35.000000', NULL, 0),
(5687150, 825125, 63398, '<td valign="top">Even having seen this beforehand and having you explain it.....I''m still impressed! Nice work, Bear!</td>', 'Even having seen this beforehand and having you explain it.....I''m still impressed! Nice work, Bear!', '2009-10-14 13:48:57.000000', NULL, 0),
