(5697972, 826107, 67152, '<td valign="top">i think you did a very nice job with the low key lighting of this rose.  I am not a fan of the choice of crop and composition.  Centering the rose gives this a static feel and the long horizontal makes the image look squished.  Adding more negative space above and below the image would help this.  Also, placing the rose off center (following more the rule of thirds) might give this one a bit more impact.</td>', 'i think you did a very nice job with the low key lighting of this rose.  I am not a fan of the choice of crop and composition.  Centering the rose gives this a static feel and the long horizontal makes the image look squished.  Adding more negative space above and below the image would help this.  Also, placing the rose off center (following more the rule of thirds) might give this one a bit more impact.', '2009-10-23 09:56:19.000000', NULL, 0),
